  "title": "DOSA mini-pipeline parameters",
  "description": "Versioned parameter contract for the Sounio mini-pipeline. The canonical artifact is this JSON; the runner validates it (including cross-field constraints), hashes it with SHA-256, and renders a strict fixed-order key=value file for the executable. Cross-field rules for this phase: stride == window_size and k_max <= window_size. min_kmer_effective_count=1 is an executable-fixture parameter, not a pilot decision.",
